==Battleground==
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horseman]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

